<title>CHINA: Soccer-Results of China soccer league games.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Results of China soccer league games.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 16th round matches of China's professional soccer league played on Sunday:</p>
<p> Jinan Taishan	  1   Beijing Guo'an    0</p>
<p> Yanbian Hyundai	1   Sichuan Quanxin   0</p>
<p> Chinese Army	   0   Tianjin Samsung   0</p>
<p> Guangdong Hongyuan   0   Shenzhen	    0</p>
<p> Guangzhou Songri     1   Dalian Wanda	1</p>
<p>(The match between Shanghai Shenhua and Guangzhou Apollo is postponed to September 17.)</p>
</text>
